y. A charge is put on your\ncredit card after the product has been packed and the order is deemed complete.\nPlease note that all credit cards are verified. You must provide a billing\naddress that corresponds to the credit card you are using. If the billing\naddress does not match the credit card, you will be informed, and the order\nwill not be processed until we hear from you.</span><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Open Sans&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>",
