-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, sans-serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, sans-serif;\">Any wines which are five years or older are purchased at the\nbuyers' own risk and are not subject to refund or return.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, sans-serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</p><p style=\"margin:0cm\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, sans-serif;\">If anything is unclear or you have more questions regarding\nreturns and refunds, feel free to contact our customer support team at&nbsp;</span><b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Open Sans&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\">540-354-4088\n</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, sans-serif;\">or write to&nbsp;<b>abc@gmail.com</b></span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, sans-serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>",
